        <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;max-width:460px;">JDM is suited to programs where product and process decisions are closely connected and where both teams expect to work together through future revisions and product generations.</p><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;max-width:460px;">Hana has customer relationships extending over decades, supported by continued engineering and manufacturing collaboration.</p>
